        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Modern Stainless Steel 11-13/16\" Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern 11-13/16 Inch Stainless Steel Flush Pull is made by JNF in Portugal. A long pull, it will certainly make a statement in any room. Although it is sizable in length, this flush pull has a mere 1/16 inch projection, making it ideal for use on pocket doors. It is available in either satin or polished stainless steel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN-416-dimentions.gif?v=1704354733\" width=\"567\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Canaropa FP416-300 Stainless Steel Flush Pull Dimensions\"></center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Rectangular Stainless Steel Flush Pull is pressure mounted into the door so screws are not needed. It can also be screwed in from the back for use on smaller doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Canaropa FP416-300 Stainless Steel Rectangular Pocket Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 11-13/16\" (300 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-5/32\" (55 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 21/32\" (17 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Height: 9-13/16\" (250 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger  Opening Width: 1\" (25 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 10-15/16\" (278 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-13/16\" (46 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</>\r\n</p>",
